<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 higher.  Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     57.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     56.50-57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     54.50-56.00</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     51.00-54.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Mostly steady on a thin test. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs     46.00-46.25</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs     48.00</p>
<p>	   550-600 lbs     48.50-49.00</p>
<p>	   600-700 lbs     scarce</p>
</text>
